    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa5d592f_2a353f46",
        "filename": "setup-ciab-pcu.yml",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 33,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000003
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-30T14:26:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Andy: part of my reservation is customization of the deployment for \"CiaB\". I continue to be concerned that by customizing deployment for a specific development use case may mean that we essentially have an internal fork and may cause issues. I would rather see the deployment be identical regardless of the environment (CiaB, cloud, physical).\n\nAdditionally, I think the plan is to eventually separate the physical deployment from the software components. So if we customize the physical deployment for MAAS it means that we also have to make the same changes for any other physical deployment model. I think this gets expensive and error prone to maintain.\n\nWhat is being accomplished by this skip tag?",
      "parentUuid": "fa5d592f_8ad78bed",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 33,
        "endChar": 25
      },
      "revId": "991d061724f86bf6d9c55771da3d35dce652566c",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa5d592f_aa480fcd",
        "filename": "setup-ciab-pcu.yml",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 33,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000010
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-30T14:44:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "David:   The purpose of CiaB is to provide a vanilla deployment of a CORD POD, without any unnecessary \"customization of the deployment\", but in a virtual environment.  As the main developer of CiaB, I have tried to be sensitive to your first concern.  Concretely, this playbook sets up the PCU in MAAS for controlling virtual machines.  I think that PCU setup is likely to be idiosyncratic based on the environment (CiaB, cloud, physical).\n\nWe want the system to be more modular, as you point out.   I think the new build system is a step in the right direction, however there is clearly more thinking that needs to happen in this area.",
      "parentUuid": "fa5d592f_2a353f46",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 33,
        "endChar": 25
      },
      "revId": "991d061724f86bf6d9c55771da3d35dce652566c",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa5d592f_ca222301",
        "filename": "setup-ciab-pcu.yml",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 33,
