      "writtenOn": "2017-08-30T14:57:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Andy, I am aware and appreciative of your efforts to minimize differences between deployment types. \n\nI have to admit I am short on background around the context of this particular task in Ansible and I am wondering why a maas used needs to be established on the CiaB server any differently than on a physical POD or on a cloud deployment.\n\nPerhaps I need to be educated on the context.",
      "parentUuid": "fa5d592f_aa480fcd",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 33,
        "endChar": 25
      },
