      "writtenOn": "2017-08-30T17:23:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "David:  I think MAAS automatically configures the IPMI interface on a physical server from the initial Linux image that gets PXE booted on the node.   The virtual compute nodes don\u0027t have built-in IPMI like the physical servers (AFAIK) so we are configuring ssh/libvirt rather than IPMI to allow MAAS to reboot the compute nodes.",
